                <img src="https://www.liujo.com/dw/image/v2/BDNR_PRD/on/demandware.static/-/Sites-liujo-master-catalog/default/dwc796710a/images/E-ZB7302T055B79215-4-N.jpeg?sw=594&sh=826" alt="Double-breasted coat in wool" class="img-secondary" loading="lazy">
